#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Duty Board v3.131.0 — Payroll 3: The Payroll Run (pass 3 of 8).

The run as ritual: inputs in through the gate, validation to zero,
compute and the run document, the variance review, approval and
posting with separated hands, and the payment that closes the loop.
Manual depth from birth: 9 chapters, 35-bank.

Deploy: apply -> commit -> then on the server:
  bench --site xlevel.clouderp.one execute duty_board.academy_seed_payroll_pro.seed_payroll_pro_track

Anchored, idempotent. Requires v3.130.0.
Run from ~/frappe-bench/apps/duty_board.
"""

import io
